  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 522.02 Multi-Use Veteran Decal Plates Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 522.02 Multi-Use Veteran Decal Plates Eligibility. Persons meeting the criteria outlined in RSA 21:50, I or RSA 21:50, II shall be eligible for participation in the multi-use veteran decal plate program.\n\nSource. #12914, eff 11-6-19; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 523.02)",
